  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Equal Rights Trust Sudan and South S 2012-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Equal Rights Trust Sudan and South S 2012-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Equal Rights Trust i syfte att skapa st&#xf6;rre m&#xe5;ngfald i      media i Sudan och Sydsudan genom att bl.a. &#xf6;ka friheten f&#xf6;r           journalister, oberoende medier och andra som anv&#xe4;nder sociala medier. Vidare syftar insatser till att &#xf6;ka kapaciteten bland MR- f&#xf6;rsvarare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Equal Rights Trust in order to create more diversity in    the media in Sudan and South Sudan, through the increase of freedom   for journalists, independent media, and others who use social media.  Furthermore the support aims at increasing the capacity of human      rights defenders.</narrative>
  </description>
